      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mermentau%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Civil War, bushwhackers and fugitives hid in Mermentau woods, sparking tales of buried treasure.",
